## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
We will verify the site locally using a local development server.
- Run `npm run dev` to launch the local Vite preview.
- Inspect console logs for any resource errors.

### Manual Verification
- **Responsive Layout**: Resize browser window to test mobile hamburger menu, grid collapse, and spacing.
- **Theme Toggle**: Click the theme toggle button to verify all color shifts match design specifications.
- **Interactions**: Hover over project cards to test the Y-axis shift and grayscale-to-color image transition. Try filtering projects to verify the filter state update.
